        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"tbk-map-wrapper\">\n\n  <h2>Find The Baking Kaur – Luxury Cake Bakery in Meerut</h2>\n\n  <p class=\"tbk-map-text\">\n    Visit our bakery in <strong>Meerut, Uttar Pradesh</strong> for premium custom cakes,\n    wedding cakes, and designer desserts. Easily locate us on Google Maps for\n    in-store visits and consultations.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"tbk-map-embed\">\n    <iframe \n      src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Fateh%20Complex%2C%20Thapar%20Nagar%20Lane%207%2C%20Meerut%2C%20UP%20250001&t=&z=15&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed\"\n      width=\"100%\" \n      height=\"380\" \n      frameborder=\"0\" \n      style=\"border:0;\" \n      allowfullscreen=\"\" \n      loading=\"lazy\"\n      referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\">\n    </iframe>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.tbk-map-wrapper {\n  max-width: 900px;\n  margin: 60px auto;\n  padding: 0 20px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.tbk-map-wrapper h2 {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.tbk-map-text {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  color: #4a4",
